<p>Summon a part of the Fearscape to intersect with the current level.</p><p>You and your target are taken to the Fearscape, trapped there until you end the spell or until your target dies.</p><p>While inside, a constant aura of flames will burn both of you for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">83, 112, 135, 154, 171</acronym> fire damage (demons are healed instead) each turn.</p><p>When the spell ends, only you and the target (if still alive) plus any loose objects are taken back to your home plane; all summons are left in the Fearscape.</p><p>This powerful spell drains 5 vim per turn initially, increasing by +1 for each turn it has been active, and ends when your vim is depleted.</p><p>It has no effect if cast from within the Fearscape.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>